    "user_request_original": "Design a chirped multilayer dielectric coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence at 0 degrees. The stack consists of 30 layers: 15 bilayers of alternating HfO2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand), starting with HfO2 adjacent to air. Bilayer thickness increases monotonically from air interface to substrate interface. Optimize three parameters: base bilayer thickness at air side, thickness increment per bilayer, and maximum bilayer thickness at substrate side. Maximize reflectance in 300-450 nm band while maximizing transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band. Total layer count is exactly 30. Materials are HfO2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) only.",
